I |","+| `terms_accepted` | Checkbox `onChanged` | Only when the box becomes ticked, not when it is unticked |","+| `registration_continue_tapped` `{amount: int, terms: bool}` | Continue button `onPressed` | Once per tap, before navigating to `/offers` |","+| `offers_scrolled` `{offset: double}` | `NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>` around the offers `ListView` | Once per scroll gesture, when scrolling stops. `offset` is `metrics.pixels`. Only the list's own notifications count (`depth == 0`) |","+","+Check: `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I did not run the app or write","+widget tests, so the event counts have not been checked on a device.","+","+## Which parts of the colleague's note applied","+","+The note fits this project: it is Flutter, it uses PostHog, and the README says","+we are on the free tier. Read literally, the spec wording (\"started typing\",","+\"moved the slider\", \"scrolled\") leads to the per-keystroke and per-frame","+pattern the note warns about.","+","+Applied:","+- **Text fields:** a once-only `bool` flag in `onChanged`.","+- **Slider:** capture in `onChangeEnd`, not `onChanged`.","+- **Scroll:** capture on `ScrollEndNotification`, not on scroll updates or a","+  `ScrollController` listener.","+- **Names and properties:** kept exactly as the spec defines them.","+","+Not applied:","+- **FocusNode tap/focus events:** the spec has no such events.","+- **Final value on focus lost:** no event needs the field's value, and the","+  values are PII anyway.","+- **Verification steps:** I did not run `PostHogConfig.debug` or look at the","+  PostHog dashboard. I don't deploy or send anything to external services.","+","+## Notes / open points","+- **\"Once per visit\":** the flags live in the registration `State`. Pushing","+  `/offers` keeps that State alive, so going Back and typing again does not","+  re-fire the \"started\" events. The flags reset only when the screen is","+  rebuilt from scratch (e.g. app restart). For a funnel that seems right; tell","+  me if product wants \"per visit\" instead.","+- **`terms_accepted` repeats:** it fires each time the box is ticked again","+  after being unticked. That is bounded by real taps, so the cost is small.","+  Ask product if it should be once only.","+- **`offers_scrolled` volume:** this is per scroll gesture, not once per visit.","+  If product only needs \"did they scroll\", a once-per-visit flag would cut the","+  volume further.","+- **`analysis_options.yaml`:** it changed on disk while I was working (an","+  `analyzer.exclude` block was added). I did not make that change and left it","+  as is."]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-9WSMzX/pubspec.lock","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":282,"newStart":0,"newLines":0,"lines":["-# Generated by pub","-# See https://dart.dev/tools/pub/glossary#lockfile","-packages:","-  async:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: async","-      sha256: e2eb0491ba5ddb6177742d2da23904574082139b07c1e33b8503b9f46f3e1a37","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"2.13.1\"","-  boolean_selector:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: boolean_selector","-      sha256: \"8aab1771e1243a5063b8b0ff68042d67334e3feab9e95b9490f9a6ebf73b42ea\"","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"2.1.2\"","-  characters:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: characters","-      sha256: faf38497bda5ead2a8c7615f4f7939df04333478bf32e4173fcb06d428b5716b","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.4.1\"","-  clock:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: clock","-      sha256: e51d50bca3217c9a9fa2b41a30e4a38971133f5f9ec7a3d57bae095007f1d28e","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.1.3\"","-  collection:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: collection","-      sha256: \"2f570